  "title": "",
  "body": "  Review the vocabulary in this lesson. Drag the vocabulary term from the left and drop it on its correct definition on the right. Click the \"Check Me\" button to see if you are correct.    Find the words in the lesson above and try again.     iteration  repetition of a sequence of instructions    while loop  a type of loop that continues as long as a condition is true    for loop  a type of loop that repeats a set of statements a specific number of times    loop variable  a variable that is used to control the number of iterations in a loop    infinite loop  a loop that never ends    tracing  the process of following the line by line keeping track of the variables and output.    "
